  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Balakrishnan vs The District Collector on 10 December, 2024 Author: G.K.Ilanthiraiyan Bench: G.K.Ilanthiraiyan W.P(MD)No.18610 Before The Madurai Bench Of Madras High Court Dated: 10.12.2024 Coram The Honourable Mr.Justice G.K.Ilanthiraiyan W.P(MD)No.18610 of 2019 Balakrishnan ... District Collector, Ramanathapuram District, Ramanathapuram. 2.The District Environmental Engineer, Tamil Nadu Pollution Control Board, No.1, Jothi Nagar, Collectorate Post, Ramanathapuram District. 3.The Food Safety Officer, R.S.Mangalam, Ramanathapuram District. 4.The Inspector of Police, R.S.Mangalam Police Station, R.S.Mangalam, Ramanathapuram District. 5.Balamurugan 6.The Executive Officer. R.S.Mangalam Town Panchayat, R.S.Mangalam, Ramanathapuram District. ... Respondents (R 6 is impleaded vide order dated 01.07.2022 Balakrishnan vs The District Collector on 10 December, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/78465999/ 1 in W.M.P(MD)No.15005 of 2020) https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis 1/5 W.P(MD)No.18610 PRAYER: Writ Petition filed under Article 226 of Constitution of India, to issue a Writ of Mandamus, directing the respondents 2 and 3 to take action against the fifth respondent herein for polluting air in and around the vicinity of the petitioner's Village and regulated his company by considering the petitio representation dated 05.08.2019 subsequently on 16.08.2019 within the time stipulated by this Court. For Petitioner : Mr.M.Thirunavukkarasu For RR 1 & 3 : Mr.M.Senthil Ayyanar Government Advocate For R 2 : Ms.Madhuri Donti Reddy Standing Counsel For R 4 : Mrs.M.Aasha",
